    descEn: "Detects the regime first (ADX + Kaufman efficiency + EMA50 slope), then runs a multi-vote trend engine inside trends and a Bollinger/RSI/VWAP reversion engine inside ranges. Research shows regime \u2014 not strategy choice \u2014 decides what works.",
